      "name": "kitchen",
      "noun": null,
      "adj": null,
      "desc": "You've just walked into a kitchen.\n\n You can see [if c_0 is locked]a locked[else if c_0 is open]an opened[otherwise]a closed[end if] fridge.[if c_0 is open and there is something in the c_0] The fridge contains [a list of things in the c_0].[end if][if c_0 is open and the c_0 contains nothing] The fridge is empty.[end if] You see an oven.[if oven_0 is open and there is something in the oven_0] The oven contains [a list of things in the oven_0].[end if][if oven_0 is open and the oven_0 contains nothing] The oven is empty.[end if] You can see a table. [if there is something on the s_0]You see [a list of things on the s_0] on the table.[end if][if there is nothing on the s_0]But there is nothing on it.[end if] You can see a counter. [if there is something on the s_1]You see [a list of things on the s_1] on the counter.[end if][if there is nothing on the s_1]But there is nothing on it.[end if] You can see a stove. [if there is something on the stove_0]You see [a list of things on the stove_0] on the stove.[end if][if there is nothing on the stove_0]But there is nothing on it.[end if]\n\n",
